<string name="Text">Lets you add decals and textures to parts. Simply add a new decal or texture, and paste the URL of the decal you want to add.

TIP: You can select the decal/texture side by right clicking.

NOTE: If HttpService is not enabled, you must type the ID of the image item (not the decal). This can usually be found by subtracting one from the ID number.</string>
